Mere Maula Aao<br />
<br />
Al Ajal<br />
ya imame zama..(2)<br />
<br />
Mere maula aao ke muddat hui hai<br />
sitam zaalimo ke uthaate uthaate<br />
tere dushmano ki guzarti hai maula<br />
tere doston ko sataate sataate<br />
<br />
1. Guzarti hai jaisi guzarenge maula<br />
na haari hai himmat na haarenge maula<br />
sitam thak gaya hai hue kund khanjar<br />
lahoo momino ka bahaate bahaate<br />
mere maula aao...<br />
<br />
2. Kahin nauha matam kahin aahozari<br />
safar karbala ka musalsal hai jaari<br />
jhuke jaa rahe hai zaeefon ke kaandhe<br />
jawaano ke laashe uthaate uthaate<br />
mere maula aao...<br />
<br />
3. La'eeno ne hum par mazaalim wo dhaaye<br />
jawan saal laashon pe laashon uthaaye<br />
chale hai shahadat ka sehra sajaaye<br />
wo shaadi ka sehra sajaate sajaate<br />
mere maula aao...<br />
<br />
4. Jo behne hai zinda to bhai nahi hai<br />
hai maa baap baaqi to bete nahi hai<br />
jo bete hai baaqi to saaya nahi hai<br />
jigar kaampta hai bataate bataate<br />
mere maula aao...<br />
<br />
5. Gharon se chale the jo purse ki khaatir<br />
wo maare gaye raaston me musaafir<br />
kabhi jaate jaate juloose aza me<br />
kabhi mash'had o karbala jaate jaate<br />
mere maula aao...<br />
<br />
6. Thi sughra ke lab par sada ye duhaai<br />
chale aao baba chale aao bhai<br />
atakti hai seene may ab meri saanse<br />
tumhein der hojaye na aate aate<br />
mere maula aao...<br />
<br />
7. Zaban se jo ki baat usne nibhayi<br />
piya thanda pani na saaye me aayi<br />
zamane se uthi hai asghar ki maadar<br />
khalayon me jhoola jhulaate jhulaate<br />
mere maula aao...<br />
<br />
8. Khuda jaanta hai wo kaisa tha manzar<br />
kaleje pe abid ke chalte the khanjar<br />
jawani zaeefi ke dar par khadi thi<br />
sakina ki turbat banate banate<br />
mere maula aao...<br />
<br />
9. Takallum ki aur haidari ki dua hai<br />
har ek simt matam hai aah-o-buka hai<br />
na aisa ho hum bhi lehed me ye bole<br />
ahut der ki meherban aate aate<br />
mere maula aao...<br />
<br />
